{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17509","headline":"上巳日贡院考杂文不遂赴九华观祓禊之会以二绝句申赠 二 · 权德舆","name":"上巳日贡院考杂文不遂赴九华观祓禊之会以二绝句申赠 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禊饮寻春兴有余，深情婉婉见双鱼。\n同心齐体如身到，临水烦君便祓除。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}